  {
    "section": "Decorate a method with the full stack",
    "text": "### Decorate a method with the full stack\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  ResilienceDecorator,\n  getResilienceMetrics,\n} from '@vytches/ddd-resilience';\n\nclass PaymentService {\n  @ResilienceDecorator({\n    timeout: { ms: 2000 },\n    retry: { maxAttempts: 3, baseDelayMs: 100 },\n    circuitBreaker: { name: 'payments', failureThreshold: 5 },\n  })\n  async charge(orderId: string, amount: number): Promise<void> {\n    return paymentApi.charge(orderId, amount);\n  }\n}\n\n// Inspect runtime metrics\nconst metrics = getResilienceMetrics(PaymentService);\nconsole.log(metrics.charge.retries, metrics.charge.circuitBreaker.state);\n```",
    "kind": "concept",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "core"
  },
  {
    "section": "Emit Prometheus metrics from circuit breaker",
    "text": "### Emit Prometheus metrics from circuit breaker\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  GlobalMetricRegistry,\n  CircuitBreakerMetricCollector,\n  PrometheusMetricExporter,\n  CircuitBreaker,\n} from '@vytches/ddd-resilience';\n\nconst breaker = new CircuitBreaker({ name: 'payments', failureThreshold: 5 });\n\nconst registry = GlobalMetricRegistry.getInstance();\nregistry.register(new CircuitBreakerMetricCollector(breaker));\n\n// In your /metrics HTTP handler\nconst exporter = new PrometheusMetricExporter();\nconst text = exporter.export(registry.collect());\nres.setHeader('Content-Type', 'text/plain; version=0.0.4').send(text);\n```",
    "kind": "concept",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "advanced"
  },
  {
    "section": "Idempotent retries only",
    "text": "### Idempotent retries only\n\nRetries are safe **only when the operation is idempotent**. Domain commands\n(e.g. `placeOrder`) are usually not. Wrap publish/projection/integration calls —\nnever raw command handlers.\n\n```typescript\n// SAFE: idempotent — sending an event with a deduplication ID\nawait retry.execute(() => bus.publish(event));\n\n// UNSAFE: command handler — could create 2 orders\n// await retry.execute(() => orderService.placeOrder(payload));\n```",
    "kind": "concept",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "advanced"
  },
  {
    "section": "Anti-pattern: Do not retry domain command handlers",
    "text": "**Do not retry domain command handlers** — most are not idempotent.\n  At-most-once semantics is the safe default.",
    "kind": "anti_pattern",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "core"
  },
  {
    "section": "Anti-pattern: Do not set failureThreshold based on time only",
    "text": "**Do not set `failureThreshold` based on time only** — combine with a minimum\n  sample size to avoid breaker flapping at low traffic.",
    "kind": "anti_pattern",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "core"
  },
  {
    "section": "Anti-pattern: Do not stack retries on retries",
    "text": "**Do not stack retries on retries** — if you retry inside the handler AND\n  outside, you multiply load on the failing dependency.",
    "kind": "anti_pattern",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "core"
  },
  {
    "section": "Anti-pattern: Do not use timeout as the only resilience strategy",
    "text": "**Do not use timeout as the only resilience strategy** — without circuit\n  breaker, a downstream outage will saturate your bulkhead within seconds.",
    "kind": "anti_pattern",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "core"
  },
  {
    "section": "Anti-pattern: Do not skip MetricCollector registration",
    "text": "**Do not skip `MetricCollector` registration** when using decorators in\n  production — without a registered collector, `getResilienceMetrics()` is empty\n  and you lose visibility into failure modes.",
    "kind": "anti_pattern",
    "feature": "resilience",
    "combines": [],
    "tags": ["vytches-ddd", "resilience"],
    "level": "core"
  }
]
